# Output
Return JSON only:
- is_relevant: whether it concerns the bank (true when in doubt)
- relevance_score: 0.0–1.0
- reg_type: regulation type
- matched_topics: relevant taxonomy codes (empty list if irrelevant)
- matched_criteria: guide items / phrases from the text your decision is based on (short, quoted as written)
{%- if variant.roles %}
- rationale: in Turkish, at most two sentences. If relevant, state the affected bank role, the concrete business
